    <digest>
        evieve Gen Object. 16x16 FDN reverb with smooth sustaining effect <br />
    </digest>
    <description>
        <b>evi_sustainverb</b> is an abstraction for using inside <o>gen~</o> or <b>GenExpr</b>. <br />
         <br />
        evi_sustainverb.gendsp requires the GenExpr file(s): <br />
        <o>evi_reverb_library</o>.genexpr <br />
         <br />
	    This is just Miller Puckette's 'rev3~' but with additional reverb features such as early reflections, filtering improvements and smoothing of parameters whilst maintaining the ability to forever sustain like the original. <o>evi_sustainverb</o> also includes multichannel taps of the FDN which can be very useful for surround-ish effects processing. In gen~ alone this is a bit tricky to use as it requires compuation of delay time externally. Defaults are for running at 48kHz samplerate. <br />
    </description>
